# PLAN: Player Time UI Refactoring

**Date**: 2025-12-13
**Goal**: Consolidate all player controls into PreviewPanel and eliminate Transport component entirely
**Based on**: STATUS-2025-12-13-playertime.md

## Overview

This plan implements the UI restructuring to consolidate all player controls into the PreviewPanel, eliminating the redundant Transport component. The changes will:
1. Move Save/Load/Export buttons to SettingsToolbar
2. Increase PreviewPanel controls height and reorganize layout (scrubber on top)
3. Move Speed/Seed controls to PreviewPanel
4. Remove Transport component completely
5. Move StatusBadge to SettingsToolbar

## Implementation Steps

### Step 1: Add Save/Load/Export to SettingsToolbar
**Complexity**: Simple
**Dependencies**: None
**Files**:
- `/Users/bmf/code/loom99-animations/gallery/src/editor/SettingsToolbar.tsx`
- `/Users/bmf/code/loom99-animations/gallery/src/editor/SettingsToolbar.css`

**Changes**:
1. Add three new buttons to `.toolbar-right` section (after Clear All button)
2. Buttons: Save, Load, Export
3. All should be `disabled` with tooltip "Phase 6"
4. Style similar to existing `.toolbar-clear-btn` but with different hover states
5. Order: Clear All | Save | Load | Export | Status

**CSS Additions**:
```css
.toolbar-action-btn {
  padding: 5px 12px;
  margin-left: 6px;
  background: transparent;
  border: 1px solid #444;
  border-radius: 4px;
  color: #888;
  font-size: 11px;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all 0.15s;
}

.toolbar-action-btn:disabled {
  opacity: 0.4;
  cursor: not-allowed;
}

.toolbar-action-btn:hover:not(:disabled) {
  background: #222;
  border-color: #4a9eff;
  color: #fff;
}
```

**Testing**:
- Verify buttons appear in top bar
- Verify disabled state
- Verify tooltips show "Phase 6"
- Verify no layout breakage

