### Step 3: Add Speed/Seed Controls to PreviewPanel
**Complexity**: Moderate
**Dependencies**: None (can be done in parallel with Steps 1-2)
**Files**:
- `/Users/bmf/code/loom99-animations/gallery/src/editor/PreviewPanel.tsx`
- `/Users/bmf/code/loom99-animations/gallery/src/editor/PreviewPanel.css`
- `/Users/bmf/code/loom99-animations/gallery/src/editor/store.ts`

**Changes**:

**PreviewPanel.tsx**:
1. Add `store?: EditorStore` to PreviewPanelProps
2. Update Editor.tsx to pass `store={store}` to PreviewPanel
3. Add local state for speed/seed or wire directly to store
4. Add input handlers for speed/seed that call `store.setSpeed()` / `store.setSeed()`
5. Add two number inputs to controls section (will be positioned in Step 4)
6. Default values if no store: speed=1.0, seed=42

**Code additions** (PreviewPanel.tsx):
```typescript
interface PreviewPanelProps {
  compilerService?: CompilerService;
  isPlaying?: boolean;
  store?: EditorStore;  // ADD THIS
}

// In component body:
const speed = store?.settings.speed ?? 1.0;
const seed = store?.settings.seed ?? 42;

const handleSpeedChange = useCallback((e: React.ChangeEvent<HTMLInputElement>) => {
  const newSpeed = parseFloat(e.target.value) || 1;
  store?.setSpeed(newSpeed);
  // Also update player speed if needed
  playerRef.current?.setSpeed?.(newSpeed);
}, [store]);

const handleSeedChange = useCallback((e: React.ChangeEvent<HTMLInputElement>) => {
  const newSeed = parseInt(e.target.value) || 0;
  store?.setSeed(newSeed);
  // Recompile will happen automatically via autoCompile
}, [store]);
```

**CSS additions** (PreviewPanel.css):
```css
.preview-setting {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6px;
}

.preview-setting-label {
  font-size: 11px;
  color: #888;
  min-width: 35px;
}

.preview-setting-input {
  width: 55px;
  padding: 4px 6px;
  background: #2a2a2a;
  border: 1px solid #444;
  border-radius: 4px;
  color: #fff;
  font-size: 11px;
  font-family: 'SF Mono', 'Monaco', monospace;
}

.preview-setting-input:focus {
  outline: none;
  border-color: #4a9eff;
}

/* Remove spinners */
.preview-setting-input::-webkit-inner-spin-button,
.preview-setting-input::-webkit-outer-spin-button {
  -webkit-appearance: none;
  margin: 0;
}

.preview-setting-input[type='number'] {
  -moz-appearance: textfield;
}
```

**Testing**:
- Verify inputs render (layout will be fixed in Step 4)
- Verify changing speed updates store and affects playback
- Verify changing seed triggers recompilation
- Verify inputs work without store prop (standalone preview)

