### Step 4: Refactor PreviewPanel Controls Layout
**Complexity**: Moderate
**Dependencies**: Step 3 complete
**Files**:
- `/Users/bmf/code/loom99-animations/gallery/src/editor/PreviewPanel.tsx`
- `/Users/bmf/code/loom99-animations/gallery/src/editor/PreviewPanel.css`

**Changes**:

**Current layout** (single row ~48px):
```
[Play] [Reset] [Loop] [Time] [===Scrubber===] [Time] [∞]
```

**New layout** (two rows ~80-96px):

**Top Row** (scrubber + time displays):
```
[Time] [===========Scrubber with cue markers===========] [Time] [∞]
```

**Bottom Row** (controls + settings):
```
[Play] [Reset] [Loop] | Speed: [1.0] | Seed: [42]
```

**PreviewPanel.tsx structure**:
```typescript
<div className="preview-controls">
  {/* Top row: Scrubber */}
  <div className="preview-controls-scrubber-row">
    <span className="preview-time">{formatTime(currentTime)}</span>
    <div className="preview-scrubber-container">
      <input type="range" className="preview-scrubber" ... />
      {/* Cue markers */}
    </div>
    <span className="preview-time">{formatTime(maxTime)}</span>
    {timeline && (
      <span className="timeline-indicator" ...>
        {timeline.kind === 'finite' ? '⏱' : '∞'}
      </span>
    )}
  </div>

  {/* Bottom row: Buttons + Settings */}
  <div className="preview-controls-buttons-row">
    <button className="preview-btn" ...>▶/⏸</button>
    <button className="preview-btn" ...>⏮</button>
    <button className="preview-btn" ...>🔁/🔀/➡️</button>

    <div className="preview-controls-divider"></div>

    <div className="preview-setting">
      <span className="preview-setting-label">Speed</span>
      <input type="number" className="preview-setting-input" ... />
    </div>

    <div className="preview-setting">
      <span className="preview-setting-label">Seed</span>
      <input type="number" className="preview-setting-input" ... />
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
```

**PreviewPanel.css changes**:
```css
/* Updated from single-row to two-row layout */
.preview-controls {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;  /* Changed from default row */
  gap: 8px;
  padding: 12px;  /* Increased from 8px */
  background: #1a1a1a;
  border-top: 1px solid #333;
}

.preview-controls-scrubber-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  min-height: 32px;  /* Taller scrubber row */
}

.preview-controls-buttons-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  min-height: 32px;
}

.preview-controls-divider {
  width: 1px;
  height: 24px;
  background: #444;
  margin: 0 4px;
}

/* Scrubber container gets more height */
.preview-scrubber-container {
  position: relative;
  flex: 1;
  height: 24px;  /* Increased from 20px */
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
}

/* Cue markers get more height */
.cue-marker {
  position: absolute;
  top: 50%;
  transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(-50%);
  width: 3px;
  height: 18px;  /* Increased from 14px */
  border-radius: 1px;
  pointer-events: none;
  z-index: 0;
  opacity: 0.7;
}

.cue-marker.cue-phase {
  background: #ffd93d;
  height: 20px;  /* Increased from 16px */
}

.cue-marker.cue-beat {
  background: #ff6b6b;
  height: 16px;  /* Increased from 12px */
}

.cue-marker.cue-marker {
  background: #4ecdc4;
  height: 14px;  /* Increased from 10px */
}
```

**Testing**:
- Verify scrubber row appears on top with larger height
- Verify cue markers render correctly with new sizes
- Verify buttons row appears below with settings
- Verify total height is approximately doubled (~80-96px)
- Verify all controls remain functional
- Verify responsive behavior

